invariant: INV-22
file: srv_quic.c
catches: quic_loop_test
reason: the QUIC server sends its Certificate and CertificateVerify on a
  handshake a ticket authenticated, which is the second connection the
  QUIC Interop Runner's resumption case fails a server for. The client
  that resumed reads the Certificate as a message out of turn.
  test/quic_loop_raw.h resumes a ticket between this tree's two QUIC
  drivers and counts the Handshake-level messages.

--- old
    // A resumed handshake sends neither message: the ticket's PSK
    // authenticates this server.
    if (!sel->psk_selected) {
--- new
    if (1) {
